","The **neuron disease** states that the basic structural and functional unit of life is the **neuron**, a small, independent cell that is the primary unit of life in the nervous nervous. This theory states that neurons are not connected end-to-end (as earlier work showed) but are discrete, discrete units that communicate with each other via synapses.

