\[
z = \frac{-2 \sqrt{3}i}{3 + \sqrt{3}i} \cdot \frac{3 - \sqrt{3}i}{3 - \sqrt{3}i} = \frac{-6 \sqrt{3}i + 6i^2}{9 - 9i^2} = \frac{-6 \sqrt{3}i - 6}{9 + 9} = \frac{-6 - 6 \sqrt{3}i}{18} = -\frac{1}{3} - \frac{\sqrt{3}}{3}i.
\]
The conjugate of $z$ is:
\[
