5. **Period of \( f(x) = 3\sin(2x + \pi/4) - 2\cos(3x - \pi/3) \):**
   - The period of \( f(x) \) is the least common multiple (LCM) of the periods of the individual terms.
   - The periods are \( \pi \) and \( \frac{2\pi}{3} \).
