Thus, the sum becomes:
\[
S_n = \sum_{k=1}^n (x^{2k} + 2x^k + 1) = \sum_{k=1}^n x^{2k} + 2 \sum_{k=1}^n x^k + \sum_{k=1}^n 1.
\]
